Package: canivt
Title: Download and Parse StatCan Beyond 20/20 IVT Tables
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jens", "von Bergmann", , "jens@mountainmath.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads and parses Statistics Canada Beyond 20/20 .ivt data
    tables into tidy data frames, Parquet, or CSV, and extracts table
    metadata such as dimension members, geographic identifiers, and
    footnotes that are not part of the data itself.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
